<title>USA: USDA--export inspections, sales delayed a day.</title>
<headline>USDA--export inspections, sales delayed a day.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1997-05-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>U.S. Agriculture Department said Tuesday it would release its weekly report on U.S. export inspections at 1100 EDT/1500 GMT and issue its weekly report on U.S. export sales at 0830 Friday.</p>
<p>Both reports were delayed a day due to the Memorial Day holiday. Export inspections data normally come out on Mondays and the export sales report is usually released on Thursdays.</p>
